 "emoji": "🔥",
 "sentences": [
  "Wildfires can launch smoke straight into the stratosphere.",
  "These towering storms are called pyrocumulonimbus clouds.",
  "They generate massive thunderheads with lightning and heavy rain.",
  "NASA's INSPYRE mission is actively chasing them with aircraft.",
  "A research plane recently sampled smoke 12 kilometers high.",
  "Wildfires may contribute up to 25 percent of stratospheric aerosols."
